{"time": 1754908626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427560302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我什么时候醒呢）"}
{"time": 1754908844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469594700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像...这下真的结束了...危险的东西..我身上还有这种东西吗..可能曾经有..但已经被我抛弃了...现在我就只是个没有任何力量的普通人..扭头看向外面的天色，静静的等待终局"}
{"time": 1754909107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387972661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那确实是很无奈的结局了)"}
{"time": 1754909292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080468682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(那确实是很无奈的结局了)"}
{"time": 1754909535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848092413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=427560302]再次醒来时，房间的窗帘已经被拉上，你感觉失去了一半的视野，仔细感受了一下才发现是一边的眼睛上缠着绷带，卡珊德拉坐在窗边，你只能看见她半边侧脸"}
{"time": 1754909640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392166091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "果然...与其这样被他们杀死..还不如自我了断算了..."}
{"time": 1754909667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355866071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是不能丢下露露一个人"}
