{"time": 1754915421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438304219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……难道你很缺爱吗？就这么喜欢变成这个样子？”*这么说着，但也无力？不愿？反抗。总感觉有什么事情在越变越糟"}
{"time": 1754916271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664028632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（出去理了个发）"}
