{"time": 1754930750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536128078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1779574566]她抿着嘴，似乎有些生气，甩开你的手，\"我最喜欢我的家人们了...错的又不是我，是那些强盗。\""}
{"time": 1754930789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993511727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“强盗是谁...”"}
