{"time": 1754930798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015704625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我这边今晚应该over了）"}
{"time": 1754931167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474422104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=993511727]\"...正在肆意屠杀我的家人们，难道你没有看见吗？\"她指着碎片，\"说起来...我要订正一下呢...这些强盗，不能成为我的家人。\""}
{"time": 1754931191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274338567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是你先把我们带到这里的么....”"}
{"time": 1754931209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995978741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家本来只是在森林里路过.”"}
{"time": 1754931272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469249284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明明是这些家伙闯进了我的庭院。\"她不满地开口，\"和我的家人们打起来的也是他们，怎么敢?\""}
{"time": 1754931331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915488285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家好好聊一聊，说不定是误会..”"}
{"time": 1754931481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144823080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"误会能让他们回来吗？\"她手中的杖尖发出危险的紫光，氤氲在一片黄绿色的荧光中，\"人类，你的选择?\""}
{"time": 1754931517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460453402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不知道...但如果你要杀了他们..那我不能成为你的家人”"}
{"time": 1754931628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412403785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"龙先生说得对....\"她语调哀伤，\"你们这些家伙果然是一路的...\"她弯下腰扯下露莉亚嘴上的胶布，\"你呢？人类。\""}
{"time": 1754932063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877068923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1791096719]“她……小屁孩，懂什么”不以为意“而且你可以消失的对不对”"}
