{"time": 1754934849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847481897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（说明大家都干了）"}
{"time": 1754934936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269552362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=826362263]\"交易?\"她低下头思考，过了一会才开口，\"...用血...换了离开的机会...\"偷偷瞄了你一眼，担惊受怕的小动物的样子"}
{"time": 1754935037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747375380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=766801815]碎片从背景里逐渐淡出，你们似乎是在一片森林中，虽然四周黑漆漆的，但其中点缀着一些游动的黄绿色荧光，几只山羊分散着吃起草来"}
{"time": 1754935075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085279651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有任何和解的可能了吗...”"}
{"time": 1754935080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497012239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哼……”*努努嘴“啊，我不是那个意思。不是你的问题。只是那家伙居然还会干这种事……真难琢磨她在想什么”"}
{"time": 1754935124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544806570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "顿了顿“最麻烦的是，我发现我对她好像越来越讨厌不起来了。这种感觉倒是更让人讨厌”"}
{"time": 1754935263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452887809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2085279651]\"我的庭院...什么时候轮到人类来打扰了。\"她似乎隐隐有些生气，\"你也是他们中的一员...不愿意做我的家人...\""}
{"time": 1754935388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337477472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我感觉...你不是坏人..”"}
{"time": 1754935420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545411264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=544806570]\"...伊芙觉得她不是好人吗？\"她的话语犹豫，似乎是有些察觉到你的态度，\"...我觉得姐姐...人很好...\""}
{"time": 1754935592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089633353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她……”犹豫了一阵，还是没细说“有时候好，有时候坏的。总之……遇到的时候谨慎一些”"}
{"time": 1754935649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937622715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337477472]\"...不要用人类的标准评价我。\"她的手杖指着你，\"人类，你很无礼。\""}
{"time": 1754935676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357577154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...对不起”"}
{"time": 1754935760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1247586370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2089633353]\"嗯...\"她乖巧地点着头，尽管还穿着睡衣，头发也乱乱的。\"去吃...早饭?\""}
{"time": 1754935888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405637591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，走吧……今天还觉得冷吗？”"}
{"time": 1754935975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1137796885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1357577154](你继续动啊)"}
{"time": 1754935979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972227030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(又没禁你言)"}
{"time": 1754935984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9889256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754936040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161012084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "如果直接走的话....师父他们有可能永远出不来了，但留在这的话，也许我能帮上忙"}
{"time": 1754936054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814275606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“成为你的家人后..会怎么样”"}
{"time": 1754936121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903074390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1405637591]\"在城堡里...还可以...\"到处燃着的碳火确实保持了室内温度在一个很稳定的范围"}
{"time": 1754936222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944829044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=814275606]\"永远留在我的身边，大家一起愉快的游戏。\"她对你好像没什么兴趣了，蹲下来看着露莉亚，\"人类，你的选择呢？\""}
{"time": 1754936315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884668140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之去吃饭呗"}
{"time": 1754936445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247641590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这座城堡里能上桌吃饭的之前只有两人，如今勉强说得上有三个，艾琳并不在餐厅。你和琳恩坐下来，早餐陆陆续续端了上来，都是些常见的食物，牛奶面包等等，你注意到琳恩只喝了几口热牛奶，咬了两口吐司就没再用餐了。"}
{"time": 1754936476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058131199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看露露怎么选"}
{"time": 1754936496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835187457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1944829044]露莉亚扶着绑着你的大树坐了起来，抬头看向了你，在这个时刻，她把决定权交给了你。"}
{"time": 1754936506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256771569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(她早就在看你了，你也不管人家)"}
{"time": 1754936520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839337021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不简单啊)"}
{"time": 1754936522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100880389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=0F23AD19D77B3046EF758DEA23C8F3A6.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhReqHBoBX3Nmqxq2RB9MkBc8iWjkxiiwwMg_woo2sjf_6-DjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQVUw0llufptfQv883inMtt3oCyO8&amp;rkey=CAQSMCUL5fW1dJ0yBcE4e4STgNgIfIVAPbTFMWIW75kIxODagMOTf-YJ6xfZml6f-lC7tw,file_size=57762]"}
{"time": 1754936536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819936226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为我想让她属于自己的选择）"}
{"time": 1754936588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462069734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一直玩游戏是？永远沉浸在自己的美好记忆中吗...还是去扮演其他人记忆中的角色”"}
{"time": 1754936684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775263770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=247641590]“怎么了，吃不惯吗？”早餐虽说的确有些单调，但琳恩……看起来还是长身体的年纪“早上确实也没什么热菜”"}
{"time": 1754936719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262302319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她显然懒得理你，一句话都没回应，\"人类...?\""}
{"time": 1754936726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213333093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1819936226](那你说啊)"}
