{"time": 1754937357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246932978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1294729027]早餐时间过得很快，或许她确实胃口不大，在你旁边等了你一会。这会倒是都吃完了，仆人们开始撤餐"}
{"time": 1754937394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080737352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=1B01CFE47A3CB517450EF9F59D1B0B96.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRSGb3o7PmrvDkMSSx-r9a_47bJOxiwtwwg_wooj9jSn7ODjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQztPBKhc1OSo0-RD3SLy78HoCQOA&amp;rkey=CAQSMCUL5fW1dJ0yBcE4e4STgNgIfIVAPbTFMWIW75kIxODagMOTf-YJ6xfZml6f-lC7tw,file_size=203696]"}
{"time": 1754937528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710098577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……今天……”*陷入一些思索“琳恩应该不想出门？”"}
{"time": 1754937601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731172788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2043970745]直到她的身形彻底消失，远方的天空中传来破晓的暮色剑气，与朝阳一起，如此醒目。"}
{"time": 1754937620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495889468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是闪灵）"}
{"time": 1754937654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190830556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...居然还活着吗”摸摸自己的胸口"}
{"time": 1754937657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988232533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1710098577]她把头摇得像拨浪鼓，\"不出门...\"而你也有一件不得不做的事"}
{"time": 1754937732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075363007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1190830556]虽然依然被绑着，但胸口被你手挖的洞和腹部新添的伤口都消失不见，就像不曾出现过，露莉亚身上那些伤口也都消弭殆尽。"}
{"time": 1754937782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100949173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么什么都不见了，这根破绳子还在这里...”"}
{"time": 1754937834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958148684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……嘛，也没办法。那琳恩就……帮我看家？我有事要出去一趟”"}
{"time": 1754937922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229375471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1958148684]\"...伊芙要出门?\"她瞪大了眼睛，\"去哪里?\""}
{"time": 1754937933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540603977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露..帮我解开一下”"}
{"time": 1754938001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368093812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去林子里。那边最近似乎不太安全，我得带人把那块封起来”"}
{"time": 1754938021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359451120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=540603977]露莉亚对着你微笑，但你看出这笑容里面绝不是开心，\"诺诺...你在这里喂狗吧...\"语气平静，但越平静越让人害怕，她一个人自顾自往着出现暮色剑气的地方走去"}
{"time": 1754938045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116738691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎哎...露露...别走啊”"}
