{"time": 1754939098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200533535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1985441009]总之，你再次醒来的时候，人已经在熟悉的马车上了，你们已经穿过了森林，虽然...你还是被绑着，而我绑得相当死。"}
{"time": 1754939169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606129135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想揉揉眼睛，但是被绑住了..“师父，能不能帮我松绑啊”"}
{"time": 1754939171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853289320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1737621562]\"嗯...\"她点点头，松开手，似乎就打算穿着睡衣跟着你。"}
