{"time": 1754988080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516845829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=619698555]艾琳顶着厚重的黑眼圈，看上去似乎是熬了夜，一只羽毛笔停在手里，\"怎么大清早就过来了？小伊芙有事吗？\""}
{"time": 1754988108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386230765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1019401594](时间上你们先进去的，然后她才封锁)"}
