{"time": 1754997268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279933115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是……”*保持距离不变“挺直了你能靠得舒服一点。就是不好加炭”"}
